From: cool-retro-term-wezterm <build@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:46:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Settings (gear) button for the integrated title bar

- IntegratedTitleButton::Settings with a gear icon (Windows/Gnome styles)
  and a ' * ' text form for the retro tab bar (tab_bar_style.window_settings)
- clicking it emits the 'settings-button-click' Lua event (window, pane);
  without a handler, or when the handler does not return false, the
  command palette opens

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
